## 5. \u1057?\u1082?\u1074?\u1086?\u1079?\u1085?\u1072?\u1103? \u1072?\u1088?\u1093?\u1080?\u1090?\u1077?\u1082?\u1090?\u1091?\u1088?\u1072? \u1076?\u1072?\u1085?\u1085?\u1099?\u1093?\par
```mermaid\par
flowchart TB\par
 U["\u1040?\u1085?\u1076?\u1088?\u1077?\u1081? / Telegram / dashboard"] --> H["Hermes / identity + policy"]\par
 H --> EX["\u1051?\u1080?\u1095?\u1085?\u1099?\u1081? executor"]\par
 H --> TC["Team Control / role workflows"]\par
 H --> KB["Kaiten adapter / allowed card snapshots"]\par
 KB <--> K["External Kaiten / business tasks"]\par
 H --> HM["Honcho scoped recall/single sender"]\par
 HM --> HD[("Own Honcho PostgreSQL + pgvector")]\par
 D["Deriver"] --> HD\par
 D --> OR["OpenRouter embeddings1536 + text models"]\par
 EX --> CAT["Warehouse + catalog / revisions ACL"]\par
 TC --> CAT\par
 CAT --> R["Checks/evidence/result"]\par
 R --> H\par
 H --> MR["Canonical message revision"]\par
 MR --> TEXT["Text delivery"]\par
 TEXT --> U\par
 MR --> PROJ["Speech projection / privacy and length policy"]\par
 PROJ --> V["Voice profile snapshot + billing gate"]\par
 V --> TTS["Edge / ElevenLabs-OpenRouter / future adapters"]\par
 TTS --> AUDIO["Decode/normalize audio + protected artifact"]\par
 AUDIO --> DEL["Delivery service / Telegram voice or player"]\par
 DEL --> U\par
```\par
\u1057?\u1090?\u1088?\u1077?\u1083?\u1082?\u1080? \u8212? interfaces/data flow, \u1085?\u1077? \u1086?\u1073?\u1097?\u1080?\u1081? filesystem mount. \u1053?\u1077?\u1083?\u1100?\u1079?\u1103? \u1085?\u1072?\u1087?\u1088?\u1072?\u1074?\u1080?\u1090?\u1100? Honcho conclusions \u1080?\u1083?\u1080? Kaiten event \u1085?\u1072?\u1087?\u1088?\u1103?\u1084?\u1091?\u1102? \u1074? paid synthesis \u1076?\u1086? authorisation/projection. \u1042?\u1085?\u1077?\u1096?\u1085?\u1080?\u1081? TTS \u1087?\u1086?\u1083?\u1091?\u1095?\u1072?\u1077?\u1090? \u1090?\u1086?\u1083?\u1100?\u1082?\u1086? \u1086?\u1076?\u1086?\u1073?\u1088?\u1077?\u1085?\u1085?\u1099?\u1081? speech_text, \u1085?\u1077? \u1074?\u1077?\u1089?\u1100? prompt/\u1087?\u1072?\u1084?\u1103?\u1090?\u1100?/credentials.\par
